<script data-page="app" type="application/json">{"component":"flashcards\/study","props":{"errors":{},"name":"Topwords","auth":{"user":{"id":5,"name":"\u00c1rp\u00e1d Szaniszl\u00f3","email":"developedbybarley@gmail.com","email_verified_at":null},"isAdmin":true,"subscription":{"plan":"premium","hasActiveAccess":true,"isSubscribed":false,"isPremium":true,"hasAiAccess":true,"isOnTrial":false}},"sidebarOpen":true,"billingEnabled":false,"flash":{"streakTriggered":null,"success":null,"error":null,"info":null,"achievements":[],"calibrationPrompt":null,"showTour":false,"importedCardId":null},"deck":{"id":41,"name":"June"},"cards":[{"id":51434,"front":"<p>After realizing she left her keys at the cafe, she had to _______ her steps all the way back. <em>(visszamegy \/ visszak\u00f6vet)<\/em><\/p><p>Detectives often have to _______ a suspect&#039;s movements to build a timeline of events. <em>(nyomon k\u00f6vet \/ felder\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>To understand the current economic crisis, we must _______ the historical factors that led to it. <em>(visszavezet \/ elemzi az el\u0151zm\u00e9nyeket)<\/em><\/p><p>The author decided to _______ her journey through the remote mountains in her latest memoir. <em>(\u00fajra bej\u00e1r \/ le\u00edrja az \u00fatj\u00e1t)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">visszamegy \/ visszak\u00f6vet \/ \u00fajra bej\u00e1r<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): el\u0151rehalad \/ folytatja \/ tov\u00e1bbmegy<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ one&#039;s steps = visszamegy a nyom\u00e1n (pl. He had to _______ his steps to find his lost wallet.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a path = \u00fajra bej\u00e1r egy utat (pl. They decided to _______ the path of their ancestors.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a journey = \u00fajra bej\u00e1r egy utaz\u00e1st (pl. The documentary will _______ the journey of the explorers.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the events = visszak\u00f6veti az esem\u00e9nyeket (pl. Police are trying to _______ the events leading up to the accident.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>retrace<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>retrace<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: retrace one&#039;s steps \/ retrace a path \/ retrace a journey \/ retrace events<\/span><\/p><p>similar: go back over \/ track back \/ revisit \/ review<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: advance \/ proceed \/ continue<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"retrace","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16","due_at":"2026-06-19T08:08:26+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-06-15T15:09:55+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-14"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"8 nap","easy":"10 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-19T08:09:58+00:00"},{"id":51417,"front":"<p>The doctor examined the wound, noting that the infection had spread deep into the surrounding ______. <em>(h\u00fas \/ sz\u00f6vet)<\/em><\/p><p>In many cultures, abstaining from eating animal ______ is a spiritual practice. <em>(h\u00fas \/ \u00e1llati test)<\/em><\/p><p>The artist&#039;s sculpture depicted the human form with remarkable detail, capturing the subtle contours of bone and ______. <em>(test \/ testi anyag)<\/em><\/p><p>He felt a chill run through his ______ as he heard the strange noise from the attic. <em>(test \/ b\u0151r)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">h\u00fas \/ test \/ testi \u00e9lvezet<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): szellem \/ l\u00e9lek \/ szellemis\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 human _______ = emberi test\/h\u00fas (pl. The painting depicted the beauty of the human _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 animal _______ = \u00e1llati h\u00fas (pl. Many vegetarians avoid eating animal _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 put _______ on the bones = h\u00fast tesz a csontokra (\u00e1tvitt \u00e9rtelemben: r\u00e9szleteket ad, kib\u0151v\u00edt) (pl. The architect needed to put more _______ on the bones of the initial design.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 one&#039;s own _______ and blood = valakinek a saj\u00e1t h\u00fasa \u00e9s v\u00e9re (rokon, csal\u00e1dtag) (pl. He would do anything for his own _______ and blood.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>flesh<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>fleshy<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>flesh<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: human flesh \/ animal flesh \/ flesh and blood \/ bare flesh<\/span><\/p><p>similar: meat \/ body \/ skin \/ tissue<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: spirit \/ soul \/ mind<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"flesh\nfleshy","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-06","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16","due_at":"2026-06-19T08:14:10+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-06-15T15:08:59+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-06","reviewed_on":"2026-06-14"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"8 nap","easy":"10 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-25T20:19:30+00:00"},{"id":51433,"front":"<p>Many people still use flip phones, but the technology is quite _______ now. <em>(elavult \/ r\u00e9gim\u00f3di)<\/em><\/p><p>The company&#039;s marketing strategies became _______ after the rise of social media. <em>(idej\u00e9tm\u00falt \/ nem hat\u00e9kony)<\/em><\/p><p>Some historical laws are considered _______ and are rarely enforced in modern society. <em>(elavult \/ \u00e9rv\u00e9ny\u00e9t vesztett)<\/em><\/p><p>Her fashion sense was a bit _______, favoring styles from two decades ago. <em>(r\u00e9gies \/ divatjam\u00falt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elavult \/ idej\u00e9tm\u00falt \/ r\u00e9gim\u00f3di<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): modern \/ korszer\u0171 \/ aktu\u00e1lis<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 become _______ = elavultt\u00e1 v\u00e1lik (pl. The software will become _______ if not updated regularly.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 an _______ system = egy elavult rendszer (pl. They are replacing an _______ system with a new one.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ technology = elavult technol\u00f3gia (pl. Many companies are still using _______ technology.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ ideas = elavult n\u00e9zetek\/\u00f6tletek (pl. We need to challenge _______ ideas about gender roles.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>outdated<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>outdated<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: outdated technology \/ outdated system \/ outdated ideas \/ outdated methods<\/span><\/p><p>similar: obsolete \/ old-fashioned \/ archaic \/ dated<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: modern \/ current \/ up-to-date<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"outdated","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"relearning","interval":1,"ease_factor":215,"repetitions":1,"lapses":1,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-18","due_at":"2026-06-18T15:26:24+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-06-18T08:09:33+00:00","interval":2,"ease_factor":235,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"1 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-19T08:10:13+00:00"},{"id":51426,"front":"<p>The boxer adopted a wide, stable _______ before throwing the punch. <em>(testtart\u00e1s \/ poz\u00edci\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>The government&#039;s _______ on environmental protection has drawn criticism from activists. <em>(\u00e1ll\u00e1spont \/ hozz\u00e1\u00e1ll\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>In his academic paper, he outlined his _______ on the controversial theory, providing extensive evidence. <em>(n\u00e9z\u0151pont \/ v\u00e9lem\u00e9ny)<\/em><\/p><p>Her defiant _______ in the face of adversity inspired many. <em>(ki\u00e1ll\u00e1s \/ magatart\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">\u00e1ll\u00e1spont \/ testtart\u00e1s \/ hozz\u00e1\u00e1ll\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): bizonytalans\u00e1g \/ ingadoz\u00e1s \/ passzivit\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 take a _______ = \u00e1ll\u00e1st foglal (pl. The company decided to take a firm _______ on the issue.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 adopt a _______ = felvesz egy testtart\u00e1st \/ \u00e1ll\u00e1spontot (pl. He adopted a defensive _______ during the debate.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 firm _______ = hat\u00e1rozott \u00e1ll\u00e1spont (pl. The president maintained a firm _______ against the rebels.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 defensive _______ = v\u00e9dekez\u0151 testtart\u00e1s \/ \u00e1ll\u00e1spont (pl. His defensive _______ made it difficult to have a productive conversation.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>stance<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>stance<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: take a stance \/ adopt a stance \/ firm stance \/ defensive stance<\/span><\/p><p>similar: posture \/ position \/ viewpoint \/ attitude<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: indecision \/ wavering \/ flexibility<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-08","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16","due_at":"2026-06-19T08:10:04+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-06-16T07:38:24+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-08","reviewed_on":"2026-06-15"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"8 nap","easy":"10 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-19T15:25:58+00:00"},{"id":51430,"front":"<p>Excuse me, could you tell me where the nearest _______ is? <em>(mosd\u00f3 \/ WC)<\/em><\/p><p>The airplane&#039;s _______ was temporarily out of order during the flight. <em>(rep\u00fcl\u0151g\u00e9p mosd\u00f3ja \/ fed\u00e9lzeti WC)<\/em><\/p><p>Guests are kindly requested to keep the communal _______ clean and tidy. <em>(k\u00f6z\u00f6s mell\u00e9khelyis\u00e9g \/ k\u00f6z\u00f6s illemhely)<\/em><\/p><p>After a long journey, the first thing I looked for upon arrival was a clean and accessible _______. <em>(mell\u00e9khelyis\u00e9g \/ WC)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">mosd\u00f3 \/ WC \/ mell\u00e9khelyis\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): tisztas\u00e1g \/ higi\u00e9nia \/ rend<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 public _______ = nyilv\u00e1nos WC (pl. The city needs more clean public _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 airplane _______ = rep\u00fcl\u0151g\u00e9p WC-je (pl. The airplane _______ was occupied.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 men&#039;s _______ = f\u00e9rfi WC (pl. The sign pointed to the men&#039;s _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ladies&#039; _______ = n\u0151i WC (pl. She asked for directions to the ladies&#039; _______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>lavatory<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>lavatory<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: public lavatory \/ airplane lavatory \/ men&#039;s lavatory \/ ladies&#039; lavatory<\/span><\/p><p>similar: toilet \/ restroom \/ washroom \/ WC<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: cleanliness \/ hygiene \/ order<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"lavatory","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16","due_at":"2026-06-19T08:08:51+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-06-15T15:17:45+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-14"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"8 nap","easy":"10 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-29T15:25:35+00:00"},{"id":51429,"front":"<p>The old sweater was so worn out that it had become soft and _______. <em>(bolyhos \/ sz\u00f6sz\u00f6s)<\/em><\/p><p>After a long night with little sleep, my thoughts were a bit _______ and unfocused. <em>(hom\u00e1lyos \/ zavaros)<\/em><\/p><p>The new camera lens produced a slightly _______ image, lacking sharp detail. <em>(elmos\u00f3dott \/ \u00e9letlen)<\/em><\/p><p>She loved the _______ feeling of the kitten&#039;s fur against her cheek. <em>(puha \/ pihe-puha)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">bolyhos \/ hom\u00e1lyos \/ elmos\u00f3dott<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): \u00e9les \/ tiszta \/ sima<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _______ feeling = puha \u00e9rz\u00e9s (pl. I love the fuzzy feeling of a new blanket.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ logic = hom\u00e1lyos logika (pl. His argument was based on fuzzy logic.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ hair = bolyhos haj (pl. She woke up with fuzzy hair after a long sleep.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ image = elmos\u00f3dott k\u00e9p (pl. The old photograph was a bit fuzzy.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>fuzzy<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>fuzzy<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>fuzzily<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>fuzziness<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: fuzzy logic \/ fuzzy feeling \/ fuzzy hair \/ fuzzy image<\/span><\/p><p>similar: hairy \/ downy \/ blurred \/ indistinct<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: clear \/ sharp \/ smooth<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16","due_at":"2026-06-19T08:10:01+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-06-15T15:17:49+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-14"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"8 nap","easy":"10 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-19T08:10:58+00:00"},{"id":51440,"front":"<p>Many young athletes _______ to compete in the Olympics one day. <em>(v\u00e1gyik \/ t\u00f6rekszik)<\/em><\/p><p>She has always _______ to achieve academic excellence and a successful career. <em>(c\u00e9loz \/ igyekszik)<\/em><\/p><p>The company _______ to be a leader in sustainable technology. <em>(t\u00f6rekszik \/ sz\u00e1nd\u00e9kozik)<\/em><\/p><p>From humble beginnings, he _