ddle on the floor. <em>(sziv\u00e1rog \/ csepeg)<\/em><\/p><p>After the initial rush, donations started to _______ into the charity fund. <em>(lassan \u00e9rkezik \/ csordog\u00e1l)<\/em><\/p><p>The company&#039;s profits have been reduced to a mere _______ this quarter due to market downturns. <em>(csek\u00e9ly mennyis\u00e9g \/ kev\u00e9s bev\u00e9tel)<\/em><\/p><p>A _______ of sunlight managed to penetrate the dense canopy, illuminating a patch of moss. <em>(v\u00e9kony sug\u00e1r \/ kev\u00e9s f\u00e9ny)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">csordog\u00e1l \/ sziv\u00e1rog \/ csepeg \/ kev\u00e9s mennyis\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): \u00e1rad \/ \u00f6mlik \/ zubog<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _______ of water = v\u00edzcsordog\u00e1l\u00e1s, v\u00edzcsepp (pl. A _______ of water was all that was left in the stream.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 money began to _______ in = lassan elkezdett befolyni a p\u00e9nz (pl. After the appeal, money began to _______ in slowly.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ out = kisziv\u00e1rog, kicsordog\u00e1l (pl. Information started to _______ out about the scandal.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ down = lecsordog\u00e1l, lefolyik (pl. Tears began to _______ down her cheeks.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>trickle<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>trickle<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>trickle<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: trickle down \/ trickle in \/ a trickle of \/ slow trickle<\/span><\/p><p>similar: drip \/ dribble \/ seep \/ ooze<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: gush \/ pour \/ flood<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"trickle","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_