ney = \u00fajra bej\u00e1r egy utaz\u00e1st (pl. The documentary will _______ the journey of the explorers.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the events = visszak\u00f6veti az esem\u00e9nyeket (pl. Police are trying to _______ the events leading up to the accident.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>retrace<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>retrace<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: retrace one&#039;s steps \/ retrace a path \/ retrace a journey \/ retrace events<\/span><\/p><p>similar: go back over \/ track back \/ revisit \/ review<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: advance \/ proceed \/ continue<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"retrace","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16","due_at":"2026-06-19T08:09:58+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-06-15T15:10:22+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-14"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"8 nap","easy":"10 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-19T08:08:26+00:00"},{"id":51442,"front":"<p>The doctor had to put several _______ in his arm after the accident. <em>(\u00f6lt\u00e9s \/ varrat)<\/em><\/p><p>She learned to _______ a beautiful pattern onto the fabric. <em>(\u00f6lt \/ varr)<\/em><\/p><p>I felt a sharp _______ in my side when I ran too fast. <em>(sz\u00far\u00f3 f\u00e1jdalom \/ oldalsz\u00far\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>Every _______ in the quilt told a story of patience and craftsmanship. <em>(\u00f6lt\u00e9s \/ varr\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">\u00f6lt\u00e9s \/ varrat \/ varr<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): sz\u00e9tfejt \/ kibont \/ sz\u00e9tvarr<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to take a _______ = \u00f6lt\u00e9st ejt (pl. The nurse had to take a few _______ to close the wound.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a wound = sebet \u00f6sszevarr (pl. The surgeon will _______ the wound carefully.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a dropped _______ = lefutott szem (k\u00f6t\u00e9sn\u00e9l) (pl. She noticed a dropped _______ in her knitting.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 in a _______ = \u00f6lt\u00e9sben (pl. h\u00edmz\u00e9s) (pl. The embroidery was done in a delicate cross-_______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>stitch<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>stitch<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>stitch<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: surgical stitch \/ cross-stitch \/ running stitch \/ to stitch up<\/span><\/p><p>similar: suture \/ sew \/ embroider \/ fasten<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: unravel \/ undo \/ unpick<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"stitch","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-11","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16","due_at":"2026-06-19T08:14:28+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-06-15T15:18:35+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-11","reviewed_on":"2026-06-14"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"8 nap","easy":"10 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-19T08:09:26+00:00"},{"id":51427,"front":"<p>The police obtained an _______ for the suspect after gathering sufficient evidence. <em>(elfogat\u00f3parancs \/ letart\u00f3ztat\u00e1si parancs)<\/em><\/p><p>Without an _______, the authorities cannot legally detain the individual. <em>(letart\u00f3ztat\u00e1si parancs \/ hivatalos elfogat\u00f3parancs)<\/em><\/p><p>The judge issued an _______ following the grand jury&#039;s indictment. <em>(elfogat\u00f3parancsot \/ letart\u00f3ztat\u00e1si v\u00e9gz\u00e9st)<\/em><\/p><p>International cooperation is often required to execute an _______ for fugitives who have fled the country. <em>(elfogat\u00f3parancsot \/ letart\u00f3ztat\u00e1si parancsot)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elfogat\u00f3parancs \/ letart\u00f3ztat\u00e1si parancs \/ k\u00f6r\u00f6z\u00e9s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): felment\u00e9s \/ szabadon bocs\u00e1t\u00e1s \/ mentess\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 issue an _______ = elfogat\u00f3parancsot kiad (pl. The judge will issue an _______ tomorrow.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 obtain an _______ = elfogat\u00f3parancsot szerez (pl. The detectives worked to obtain an _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 execute an _______ = elfogat\u00f3parancsot v\u00e9grehajt (pl. They were tasked to execute an _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 outstanding _______ = kiadatlan\/\u00e9rv\u00e9nyes elfogat\u00f3parancs (pl. There&#039;s an outstanding _______ for his arrest.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>arrest warrant<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>arrest warrant<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: issue an arrest warrant \/ obtain an arrest warrant \/ execute an arrest warrant \/ outstanding arrest warrant<\/span><\/p><p>similar: bench warrant \/ warrant of arrest \/ apprehension order<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: release order \/ acquittal \/ exoneration<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-08","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16","due_at":"2026-06-19T08:09:37+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-06-15T15:17:58+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-08","reviewed_on":"2026-06-14"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"8 nap","easy":"10 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-19T15:18:22+00:00"},{"id":51447,"front":"<p>Someone tried to _______ with the lock on the back door, but couldn&#039;t get it open. <em>(piszk\u00e1l \/ babr\u00e1l)<\/em><\/p><p>It is illegal to _______ with the evidence in a criminal investigation. <em>(manipul\u00e1l \/ meghamis\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>Please do not _______ with the settings on the thermostat; it&#039;s set perfectly. <em>(\u00e1ll\u00edtgat \/ m\u00f3dos\u00edtgat)<\/em><\/p><p>The security system is designed to prevent anyone from attempting to _______ with the internal wiring. <em>(belepiszk\u00e1l \/ hozz\u00e1ny\u00fal)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">piszk\u00e1l \/ babr\u00e1l \/ manipul\u00e1l<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): \u00e9rintetlen\u00fcl hagy \/ b\u00e9k\u00e9n hagy \/ nem ny\u00fal hozz\u00e1<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ with something = piszk\u00e1l\/babr\u00e1l valamivel (pl. Don&#039;t _______ with the wires.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ with evidence = bizony\u00edt\u00e9kot manipul\u00e1l\/hamis\u00edt (pl. He was accused of trying to _______ with evidence.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ with the controls = a kezel\u0151szervekkel babr\u00e1l\/\u00e1ll\u00edtgat (pl. The child kept trying to _______ with the controls.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ with a device = egy eszk\u00f6zzel piszk\u00e1l\/babr\u00e1l (pl. Someone had clearly tried to _______ with the device.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>tamper<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>tampering<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>tamper<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: tamper with \/ tamper proof \/ tamper resistant \/ tamper evident<\/span><\/p><p>similar: meddle \/ interfere \/ falsify \/ manipulate<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: leave alone \/ preserve \/ safeguard<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"tamper\ntampering","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-11","reviewed_on":"2026-06-17","due_at":"2026-06-18T20:18:31+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-16T08:25:09+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-11","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"2 nap","good":"3 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-18T15:36:09+00:00"},{"id":51441,"front":"<p>My grandmother is becoming quite _______; she often misplaces her keys and forgets appointments. <em>(feled\u00e9keny \/ sz\u00f3rakozott)<\/em><\/p><p>Due to his _______ nature, he always writes important dates down in his planner. <em>(feled\u00e9keny \/ eml\u00e9kezetzavaros)<\/em><\/p><p>The witness&#039;s _______ testimony made it difficult for the jury to piece together the events of that evening. <em>(feled\u00e9keny \/ bizonytalan eml\u00e9kezet\u0171)<\/em><\/p><p>In the poem, the old man laments his _______ mind, which struggles to recall the joys of youth. <em>(feled\u00e9keny \/ gyenge eml\u00e9kezet\u0171)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">feled\u00e9keny \/ sz\u00f3rakozott \/ eml\u00e9kezetzavaros<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): j\u00f3 mem\u00f3ri\u00e1j\u00fa \/ \u00e9les esz\u0171 \/ eml\u00e9kez\u0151<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 become _______ = feled\u00e9kenny\u00e9 v\u00e1lik (pl. He&#039;s starting to become _______ in his old age.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a bit _______ = kicsit feled\u00e9keny (pl. I&#039;m a bit _______ today, I can&#039;t remember where I put my phone.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 naturally _______ = term\u00e9szet\u00e9n\u00e9l fogva feled\u00e9keny (pl. She&#039;s naturally _______, so she always makes lists.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 increasingly _______ = egyre feled\u00e9kenyebb (pl. As he got older, he became increasingly _______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>forgetful<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>forgetful<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>forgetfully<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>forgetfulness<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: forgetful person \/ forgetful mind \/ forgetful nature \/ forgetful memory<\/span><\/p><p>similar: absent-minded \/ unmindful \/ oblivious \/ distracted<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: mindful \/ remembering \/ attentive<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"forgetful\nforgetfully\nforgetfulness","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-11","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16","due_at":"2026-06-19T08:12:14+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-06-15T15:18:31+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-11","reviewed_on":"2026-06-14"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"8 nap","easy":"10 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-21T08:12:49+00:00"},{"id":51446,"front":"<p>The old photograph managed to _______ a strong sense of nostalgia in her. <em>(felid\u00e9z \/ el\u0151h\u00edv)<\/em><\/p><p>The politician's speech was designed to _______ a sense of national pride among the citizens. <em>(kiv\u00e1lt \/ \u00e9breszt)<\/em><\/p><p>Certain smells can _______ vivid memories of childhood. <em>(el\u0151id\u00e9z \/ felid\u00e9z)<\/em><\/p><p>The artist's abstract work aims to _______ a range of emotions rather than depict a specific scene. <em>(kelt \/ el\u0151id\u00e9z)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 197, 94);\">felid\u00e9z \/ <\/span><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 197, 94);\">el\u0151id\u00e9z<\/span><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 197, 94);\">\/ kiv\u00e1lt \/<\/span><\/p><p><span>Negative meaning (HU): elnyom \/ elfojt \/ megakad\u00e1lyoz<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a memory = eml\u00e9ket felid\u00e9z (pl. The scent of freshly baked bread can often _______ a memory of childhood.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ an emotion = \u00e9rz\u00e9st kiv\u00e1lt\/kelt (pl. The sad music seemed to _______ an emotion of deep sorrow.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a response = v\u00e1laszt kiv\u00e1lt (pl. His provocative statement was intended to _______ a strong response from the audience.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ an image = k\u00e9pet felid\u00e9z (pl. The description was so vivid it managed to _______ an image in my mind.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>evoke<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>evocation<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>evoke<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: evoke memories \/ evoke emotions \/ evoke a feeling \/ evoke a response<\/span><\/p><p>similar: arouse \/ elicit \/ call forth \/ conjure up<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: suppress \/ quash \/ stifle<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"evoke\nevocation","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-11","reviewed_on