ive: <strong>remedial<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>remedy<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>remedy<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: effective remedy \/ natural remedy \/ seek a remedy \/ find a remedy<\/span><\/p><p>similar: cure \/ solution \/ treatment \/ antidote<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: disease \/ problem \/ ailment<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"ease_factor":235,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-11","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16","due_at":"2026-06-19T08:10:52+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-06-15T10:40:51+00:00","interval":2,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-11","reviewed_on":"2026-06-13"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"7 nap","easy":"9 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-21T08:12:37+00:00"},{"id":51433,"front":"<p>Many people still use flip phones, but the technology is quite _______ now. <em>(elavult \/ r\u00e9gim\u00f3di)<\/em><\/p><p>The company&#039;s marketing strategies became _______ after the rise of social media. <em>(idej\u00e9tm\u00falt \/ nem hat\u00e9kony)<\/em><\/p><p>Some historical laws are considered _______ and are rarely enforced in modern society. <em>(elavult \/ \u00e9rv\u00e9ny\u00e9t vesztett)<\/em><\/p><p>Her fashion sense was a bit _______, favoring styles from two decades ago. <em>(r\u00e9gies \/ divatjam\u00falt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elavult \/ idej\u00e9tm\u00falt \/ r\u00e9gim\u00f3di<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): modern \/ korszer\u0171 \/ aktu\u00e1lis<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 become _______ = elavultt\u00e1 v\u00e1lik (pl. The software will become _______ if not updated regularly.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 an _______ system = egy elavult rendszer (pl. They are replacing an _______ system with a new one.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ technology = elavult technol\u00f3gia (pl. Many companies are still using _______ technology.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ ideas = elavult n\u00e9zetek\/\u00f6tletek (pl. We need to challenge _______ ideas about gender roles.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>outdated<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>outdated<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: outdated technology \/ outdated system \/ outdated ideas \/ outdated methods<\/span><\/p><p>similar: obsolete \/ old-fashioned \/ archaic \/ dated<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: modern \/ current \/ up-to-date<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"outdated","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16","due_at":"2026-06-19T08:10:13+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-06-15T15:20:03+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-14"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"8 nap","easy":"10 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-18T15:26:24+00:00"},{"id":51447,"front":"<p>Someone tried to _______ with the lock on the back door, but couldn&#039;t get it open. <em>(piszk\u00e1l \/ babr\u00e1l)<\/em><\/p><p>It is illegal to _______ with the evidence in a criminal investigation. <em>(manipul\u00e1l \/ meghamis\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>Please do not _______ with the settings on the thermostat; it&#039;s set perfectly. <em>(\u00e1ll\u00edtgat \/ m\u00f3dos\u00edtgat)<\/em><\/p><p>The security system is designed to prevent anyone from