etitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-11","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"2 nap","good":"3 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-19T15:06:50+00:00"},{"id":51429,"front":"<p>The old sweater was so worn out that it had become soft and _______. <em>(bolyhos \/ sz\u00f6sz\u00f6s)<\/em><\/p><p>After a long night with little sleep, my thoughts were a bit _______ and unfocused. <em>(hom\u00e1lyos \/ zavaros)<\/em><\/p><p>The new camera lens produced a slightly _______ image, lacking sharp detail. <em>(elmos\u00f3dott \/ \u00e9letlen)<\/em><\/p><p>She loved the _______ feeling of the kitten&#039;s fur against her cheek. <em>(puha \/ pihe-puha)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">bolyhos \/ hom\u00e1lyos \/ elmos\u00f3dott<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): \u00e9les \/ tiszta \/ sima<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _______ feeling = puha \u00e9rz\u00e9s (pl. I love the fuzzy feeling of a new blanket.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ logic = hom\u00e1lyos logika (pl. His argument was based on fuzzy logic.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ hair = bolyhos haj (pl. She woke up with fuzzy hair after a long sleep.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ image = elmos\u00f3dott k\u00e9p (pl. The old photograph was a bit fuzzy.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>fuzzy<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>fuzzy<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>fuzzily<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>fuzziness<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: fuzzy logic \/ fuzzy feeling \/ fuzzy hair \/ fuzzy image<\/span><\/p><p>similar: hairy \/ downy \/ blurred \/ indistinct<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: clear \/ sharp \/ smooth<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"