es = felt\u00e1mad a hamvaib\u00f3l (pl. After the defeat, the team vowed to _______ from the ashes.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>rise<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>risen<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>rise<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>rise<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: rise and fall \/ rise in temperature \/ rise to the occasion \/ rise from bed<\/span><\/p><p>similar: ascend \/ climb \/ increase \/ mount<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: fall \/ drop \/ descend<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"rise","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16","due_at":"2026-06-19T08:06:05+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-06-15T15:18:04+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-09","reviewed_on":"2026-06-14"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"8 nap","easy":"10 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-19T15:25:32+00:00"},{"id":51435,"front":"<p>The news of the sudden factory closure caused considerable _______ among the employees. <em>(nyugtalans\u00e1got \/ aggodalmat)<\/em><\/p><p>A sense of _______ settled over the village after the mysterious disappearance. <em>(nyugtalans\u00e1g \/ zavarts\u00e1g)<\/em><\/p><p>His unusual silence began to _______ his parents, who were used to his constant chatter. <em>(nyugtalan\u00edtani \/ aggasztani)<\/em><\/p><p>The government&#039;s new policy on education has created widespread _______ in academic circles. <em>(el\u00e9gedetlens\u00e9get \/ aggodalmat)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">nyugtalans\u00e1g \/ aggodalom \/ zavar \/ nyugtalan\u00edt \/ aggaszt<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; paddin